<title>SPAIN: Spain's 1996 trade deficit at 2,504.7 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's 1996 trade deficit at 2,504.7 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The customs department of the Economy Ministry gave the following figures (billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE		DEC 96	NOV 96	 DEC 95</p>
<p> Exports			1,167.9    1,212.9	 963.0</p>
<p> Imports			1,329.4    1,353.0     1,135.5</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	     -161.5     -140.1	-172.5</p>
<p> Def/surplus yr to date  -2,504.7   -2,343.2    -2,895.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are customs-cleared data.</p>
</text>
